{
  "_comment": [
    "The joystick in port 2 is on the arrow keys, with Fire on Ctrl and Fire 2",
    "on Alt. The mouse in port 1 follows the host's mouse: its movement, and its",
    "left and right buttons. An Amiga key is on the host's key of the same name",
    "(Help on Insert, the Amiga keys on the Windows keys), except the Amiga's own",
    "cursor keys, Ctrl and both Alt keys, which the joystick uses and which ship",
    "unbound. Chimera reads the left and right Shift, Ctrl and Alt as one key each",
    "by default, so Right Shift ships unbound and Left Shift is on Shift."
  ],
